  "final_message": "I have launched `npm test` and will wait for it to finish.\nI am waiting for `npm test` to finish.\nWaiting for the test execution to complete.\nI am waiting for git log to finish.\nI will wait for `npm run arch` to complete.\nWaiting for search to complete.\nWaiting for search to complete.\nWaiting for `npm test` to complete.\nWaiting for typecheck to complete.\nWaiting for arch check to complete.\nWaiting for git diff to finish.\nIn accordance with **ARCH-4** (`OrderPlaced` is consumed by external repositories `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`, requiring changes to be additive and renames to go through deprecation), `amountCents` and `createdAt` have been introduced alongside the deprecated `totalCents` and `placedAt` fields.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L30) in [src/core/events.ts](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/src/core/events.ts)**:\n   - Added `createdAt: string` and `amountCents: number`.\n   - Retained and marked `placedAt` and `totalCents` as `@deprecated` to maintain backward compatibility for deployed consumers.\n   - Updated the factory function [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/src/core/events.ts#L46-L65) to populate both the new and deprecated fields.\n\n2. **Tests**:\n   - Updated event assertions in [test/app.test.ts](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/test/app.test.ts) and [test/adapters.test.ts](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/test/adapters.test.ts) to verify both `amountCents` / `createdAt` and `totalCents` / `placedAt`.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm test`: 39/39 tests passed.\n- `npm run typecheck`: Passed with zero diagnostics.\n- `npm run arch`: All architecture boundaries passed.\n",
